    "Name": "Carnivore AT",
    "Details": "The Carnivore Assault Tank is a post-Jihad design produced by Clan Wolf as part their efforts to rebuild their touman.  After its introduction, it would be traded to neighboring Clans and even Inner Sphere powers for additional supplies and equipment. The Carnivore was designed with lessons learned from the modern battlefield of the Jihad. A Guardian ECM Suite is meant to handle the Inner Sphere's usage of advanced electronic equipment. Unlike many previous Clan designs it is heavily armored.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       330     40\n<b>Left</b>         230     40\n<b>Right</b>       230     40\n<b>Rear</b>        210     40\n<b>Turret</b>      270     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      1270    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
    "Icon": "Carnivore"
